    {
      "name": "itemLores",
      "entries": [
        {
          "key": "Linh_Me",
          "value": "It is said that spirit rice tended with clear spring water and stable earth veins yields fuller grains, richer aroma, and meals that slowly strengthen one's inner reserves."
        }
